title: mf gui view
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Scripting the GUI]]
kind: reference
summary: Print or set the panel type shown in a slot

With a slot alone, prints the panel type it shows. With a type, sets it, showing the slot if it was hidden ([[Panel types]]). `--path`, for the `file` type, also selects that file in the slot's workspace — its metarecord with it — and an ''empty'' path clears the selection, so that the panel shows no file ([[file panel]]).
